Short:        Search your TurboCAT 4 Amiga collection catalogue
Author:       David Hill (tcpturbocat@gmail.com)
Uploader:     tcpturbocat@gmail.com (David Hill)
Type:         disk/misc
Version:      4.0 alpha 7
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 1.3.0
Distribution: Aminet
License:      GPL-3.0-or-later

TurboView 4 is the Amiga side of TurboCAT 4, the revival of TurboCAT and TurboCAT-Pro
(1994-1996). TurboCAT 4 runs on Windows, macOS and Linux and catalogues your Amiga disk
images; TurboView lets you search that catalogue on a real Amiga, to find which disk or
Gotek image holds the game or tool you want.

- Runs on any Amiga, Kickstart 1.3 or later (a window on Workbench from 2.04, the Shell
  on 1.3); a Workbench tool with its own icon and tooltypes.
- TurboCAT makes two TurboView floppies for you (for a Gotek or real disks): disk 1 with
  every disk and what is on it, disk 2 with a quick name index. Or install it on a hard
  drive with: TurboView:TurboView INSTALL DH0:TurboCAT
- An installed TurboView offers to update itself when newer TurboView disks are in a drive.

TurboCAT 4 and its source: https://github.com/davidhill99/TurboCAT4
Includes Keir Fraser's public-domain 68000 inflate (github.com/keirf/amiga-stuff).
New and still being tested on real Amigas: reports are very welcome.
